<%# 3. 해결 방식 — 월간 사이클 4스텝 + 각 스텝 소요 시간 (PRD 5장의 랜딩 버전, 13.2) %>
<section class="border-b border-line bg-surface">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 md:py-20">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl"><%= t("landing.solution.title") %></h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted"><%= t("landing.solution.subtitle") %></p>
    <ol class="mt-8 space-y-3">
      <% 1.upto(4) do |i| %>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-line bg-canvas p-4 md:p-5">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-sm font-bold text-white" aria-hidden="true"><%= i %></span>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <p class="text-base font-bold text-ink"><%= t("landing.solution.step#{i}_title") %></p>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-brand-200 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-700"><%= t("landing.solution.step#{i}_time") %></span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted"><%= t("landing.solution.step#{i}_copy") %></p>
          </div>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
